OL,3,GNEWSA'I walked down the aisle with my  
OL,4,Arabbit and a Lego bouquet'             
OL,6,FWhite dresses, fruitcakes and bouquets 
OL,7,Fmay all be associated with a           
OL,8,Ftraditional wedding - but they are by  
OL,9,Fno means compulsory for a growing      
OL,10,Fnumber of couples when they tie the    
OL,11,Fknot.                                  
OL,13,FDress designer Jo Millburn aims to     
OL,14,Fcater for them at her alternative      
OL,15,Fbridal wear business in Birmingham.    
OL,17,FShe said people often visit her shop   
OL,18,Fbecause they have a wild idea that     
OL,19,Fregular stores would not typically     
OL,20,Fcreate.                                
